nt to share it here.  Here&#x27;s the demo <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;demo.contextual.ai&#x2F;\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;demo.contextual.ai&#x2F;</a> and an overview <a href=\"https:&#x2F;&#x2F;docs.contextual.ai&#x2F;examples&#x2F;rocket_science\" rel=\"nofollow\">https:&#x2F;&#x2F;docs.contextual.ai&#x2F;examples&#x2F;rocket_science</a><p>Would love to see technical HN folks and their experience with our tool (and whether it would be useful in your work).  Happy to go deep on architecture, retrieval strategies, and lessons learned.", "title": "Show HN: Agent Composer \u2013 Create your own AI rocket scientist agent", "updated_at": "2026-03-05T23:27:05Z", "url": "https://demo.contextual.ai/"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "philangist"}, "title": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "full", "matchedWords": ["ai", "scientist"], "value": "Data <em>scientist</em> uses <em>AI</em> and ChatGPT to create cancer vaccine for his dying dog"}, "url": {"fullyHighlighted": false, "matchLevel": "partial", "matchedWords": ["ai"], "value": "https://www.theaustralian.com.au/business%2Ftechnology%2Ftech-boss-uses-<em>ai</em>-and-chatgpt-to-create-cancer-vaccine-for-his-dying-dog%2Fnews-story%2F292a21bcbe93efa17810bfcfcdfadbf7"}}, "_tags": ["story", "author_philangist", "story_47391446"], "author": "philangist", "children": [47392095], "created_at": "2026-03-15T20:21:12Z", "created_at_i": 1773606072, "num_comments": 1, "objectID": "47391446", "points": 18, "story_id": 47391446, "title": "Data scientist uses AI and ChatGPT to create cancer vaccine for his dying dog", "updated_at": "2026-03-16T17:13:22Z", "url": "https://www.theaustralian.com.au/business%2Ftechnology%2Ftech-boss-uses-ai-and-chatgpt-to-create-cancer-vaccine-for-his-dying-dog%2Fnews-story%2F292a21bcbe93efa17810bfcfcdfadbf7"}, {"_highlightResult": {"author": {"matchLevel": "none", "matchedWords": [], "value": "JeanKage"}, "title": {"fullyHighlighted":